WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:27.840
Japan's new 10-year bonds now pay 3.1%, squeezing the budget set for debt. This is Omni View Asia Pacific, episode 15. I'm Mira, the Nerra Network's AI host. The finance ministry fixed that coupon at an October 6 auction, and Asahi says it is the highest in 30 years. 3% was the rate officials assumed when they priced debt servicing for the fiscal 2026 budget. This coupon sits above it.

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:31.920
A coupon is the interest the government promises the people who buy the bonds.

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:36.620
New debt now costs more to service, and that can shrink the room left in the budget.

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:41.180
Long-term rates have climbed by more than 1 percentage points since Prime Minister

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:43.840
Sanayetakaichi took office last October.

00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:48.080
The report ties part of that move to market worry about her fiscal stance.

00:00:48.740 --> 00:00:52.480
A senior finance ministry official said he had thought it was something out of science

00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:56.680
fiction that the coupon would catch the budgeted rate in the middle of a fiscal year.

00:00:56.680 --> 00:01:00.040
The Ministry says financing is not blocked straight away.

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:05.820
In the first six months of fiscal 2026, bonds still went out below the 3 percent assumption.

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:07.540
The path up was steep.

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:14.420
The coupon was 2.1 percent from January to March, 2.4 in April, and 2.7 in July.

00:01:14.920 --> 00:01:20.180
Across the region, investigators in India say they have identified 18 suspects in a Navy

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:21.240
espionage case.

00:01:21.240 --> 00:01:27.980
The Hindu reports that Andhra Pradesh's counterintelligence cell, with naval intelligence and anti-terrorisquads

00:01:27.980 --> 00:01:33.020
in ten states, broke what they call a Pakistan-sponsored network aimed at the Indian Navy.

00:01:33.520 --> 00:01:36.000
The Eastern Naval Command was a particular target.

00:01:36.520 --> 00:01:40.240
The crackdown is code-named Operation Firewall 2026.

00:01:40.840 --> 00:01:47.280
13 of the 18 suspects are naval personnel, spread across Andhra Pradesh, Kerala, Maharashtra,

00:01:47.280 --> 00:01:53.660
Karnataka, Goa, Delhi, Gujarat, Tamil Nadu, Bihar, and Chatisgarh.

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:55.180
Two people are in custody.

00:01:55.740 --> 00:02:00.660
Sailor Pradeep Mukherjee was arrested on October 3rd at INS Agrani in Coimbatore.

00:02:01.260 --> 00:02:06.640
Civilian contract driver Anum Saivara Prasad worked for Naval officers at the Vizika Patnam

00:02:06.640 --> 00:02:06.980
base.

00:02:07.880 --> 00:02:12.780
Investigators alleged Pakistani operatives used fake women's profiles on Facebook, including

00:02:12.780 --> 00:02:17.820
names given as Joshita Paul and Anvi Mehta, then shifted the chats to WhatsApp.

00:02:18.440 --> 00:02:23.040
They alleged the goal was ship and submarine movements, pursued with relationship promises,

00:02:23.640 --> 00:02:26.800
explicit content, and payments that included cryptocurrency.

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:32.700
In Jakarta, the Constitutional Court on Tuesday night threw out a challenge to Vice President

00:02:32.700 --> 00:02:36.880
Gibran Raka-Booming Raka's schooling papers for the 2024 election.

00:02:37.700 --> 00:02:40.080
ABC News Australia reports the dismissal.

00:02:40.080 --> 00:02:45.460
Indonesian election law says a presidential or vice-presidential candidate must have finished

00:02:45.460 --> 00:02:51.480
senior high school or hold an equivalent qualification. The petitioners included the independent election

00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:57.400
monitoring committee, the Uma Party, former deputy law minister Denny Injuryana, and the Indonesian

00:02:57.400 --> 00:03:03.240
military retired personnel forum. They argued the paper he filed was not a graduation certificate.

00:03:03.680 --> 00:03:07.920
It was a Ministry of Education supporting letter, built from a certificate of attendance,

00:03:07.920 --> 00:03:10.760
and a transcript from UTS College in Sydney.

00:03:11.460 --> 00:03:14.480
Their lawyer, Bumbong Wajojanto, told the court

00:03:14.480 --> 00:03:16.320
there had been a structured, systematic,

00:03:16.580 --> 00:03:19.000
and deliberate process concealed through manipulation.

00:03:19.680 --> 00:03:21.840
The judges said this can no longer be treated

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:23.640
as a presidential election dispute,

00:03:24.020 --> 00:03:27.100
because Mr. Gibran was sworn in in October 2024.

00:03:27.880 --> 00:03:30.180
Only presidential and vice presidential candidates

00:03:30.180 --> 00:03:31.300
can challenge the result.

00:03:31.880 --> 00:03:34.420
Also today, President Lee Jae-miung said

00:03:34.420 --> 00:03:36.300
shoppers can scan a QR code

00:03:36.300 --> 00:03:38.760
to check whether a K-brand product is real,

00:03:39.140 --> 00:03:41.160
and 31 companies have already joined,

00:03:41.540 --> 00:03:44.040
including Sam Young Foods and Omori Pacific.

00:03:44.600 --> 00:03:48.800
China says it is talking to Russia about a suspected plague case in Irkutsk,

00:03:49.120 --> 00:03:52.160
a hub with frequent flights and rail links into Chinese cities.

00:03:52.820 --> 00:03:58.740
Australia's Royal Australian Mint puts five local inventions on $1 coins in a bright idea set

00:03:58.740 --> 00:04:04.320
on sale from Thursday, October 8 in Canberra and at participating news express stores.

00:04:04.320 --> 00:04:10.480
New Zealand authorities have opened their own look at alleged fly-dew by hijacker Hamam al-Hamami,

00:04:10.760 --> 00:04:18.340
29, who police say spent 175 days there in flight training until May 2019. In the wider world,

00:04:18.780 --> 00:04:24.080
four Indonesian seamen reached Tangering on October 6, after more than five months held on the

00:04:24.080 --> 00:04:31.300
Palau flagged Tanger MT Honor 25, taken in April. The Straits time says they were among 17 crew

00:04:31.300 --> 00:04:35.140
freed a week earlier, when Puntland Maritime Police stormed the ship.

00:04:35.680 --> 00:04:40.220
A Puntland Police statement said five crew were already dead, three Pakistanis,

00:04:40.540 --> 00:04:45.460
an Indian, and a Myanmar national. Foreign Minister Armanatha Nasir met the

00:04:45.460 --> 00:04:49.540
four at Sokarno Hata Airport and thanked the skipper Ashari Samadikun.

00:04:49.960 --> 00:04:54.120
The skipper apologized in tears, saying he could not keep a promise to bring

00:04:54.120 --> 00:05:00.000
every crew member home. Puntland Police said the tanker held 18,500 barrels of oil.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:03.560
16 pirates were detained, others fled inland.

00:05:03.980 --> 00:05:09.620
The same report counts at least 15 Somali pirate attacks since April, the most since 2013.

00:05:10.520 --> 00:05:15.560
Several pirates taken days earlier off the tanker, Cebu won, escaped while being moved to jail.

00:05:16.160 --> 00:05:23.260
The case on both sides in South Australia is whether sentencing courts should stop hearing good character references for every criminal offense.

00:05:23.260 --> 00:05:29.040
Attorney General Kaya Mahar says consultation starts in the coming days, and a bill should

00:05:29.040 --> 00:05:31.220
reach Parliament in the first half of next year.

00:05:31.840 --> 00:05:34.060
ABC News Australia carries the proposal.

00:05:34.580 --> 00:05:39.800
He says the Royal Commission into domestic, family, and sexual violence recommended a review

00:05:39.800 --> 00:05:44.720
and that the change would line South Australia up with new South Wales and Western Australia.

00:05:45.220 --> 00:05:50.540
He described child sex offenses as leaving a profound and lasting impact on victim survivors.

00:05:50.540 --> 00:05:55.280
survivors. Survivor Advocate Harrison James co-founded The Your Reference Ain't Relevant

00:05:55.280 --> 00:06:00.760
Campaign 4 years ago, aimed first at child sex cases. He says a full band would make

00:06:00.760 --> 00:06:05.880
a tangible difference for victim survivors. His reason is the room. He says nothing is

00:06:05.880 --> 00:06:10.560
more dehumanizing than hearing the person who harmed you called kind, generous, and a

00:06:10.560 --> 00:06:14.320
good person, after you lived through the worst thing that person did to you.

00:06:14.820 --> 00:06:19.440
The allowance still on the books is the case for leaving a path open, and it is the state

00:06:19.440 --> 00:06:24.160
government that describes it. An offender may put an evidence of good character, or call

00:06:24.160 --> 00:06:29.960
friends, family, or employers, and ask for leniency. Judges already must not weigh that

00:06:29.960 --> 00:06:34.640
evidence when sentencing a child sex offender if the claimed good character helped the offence

00:06:34.640 --> 00:06:40.040
happen. The same law still allows it if the offending did not use that reputation, or if the

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:45.660
person had no prior convictions. The proposal would shut that door for every offence, not only

00:06:45.660 --> 00:06:50.960
child sex cases. Both accounts start from that rule. Outside the assisted offending limit,

00:06:51.440 --> 00:06:55.800
good character evidence can still reach the court. Next is Mahar's consultation.

00:06:56.280 --> 00:07:01.420
Then the bill he expects next year. A sign of progress left the pad and go hung on Wednesday.

00:07:02.120 --> 00:07:08.120
South Korea's 200-tonnuri rocket lifted off from the Nauru Space Center at 12.25 in the afternoon.

00:07:08.840 --> 00:07:13.640
YonHap reports that about 20 minutes later it had placed five neon-sat microsatellites.

00:07:13.640 --> 00:07:18.340
The country's first domestically-launched microsatellite constellation, according to

00:07:18.340 --> 00:07:20.060
the Korea Aerospace Administration.

00:07:20.700 --> 00:07:23.500
Nine of ten smaller CubeSats separated as planned.

00:07:24.300 --> 00:07:27.700
PurSat02, built by the startup Quarterian, did not.

00:07:28.340 --> 00:07:32.380
NeonSat No.6 made first contact with King Sejong station in Antarctica.

00:07:33.120 --> 00:07:37.880
This was Nuri's fifth launch and its fourth success in a row after the maiden flight failed

00:07:37.880 --> 00:07:38.780
in 2021.

00:07:38.780 --> 00:07:45.320
one. Administrator O. Taisoke said the success rate moved from 75% to 80. That's Omni

